    <body ev:onpageload="scwin.onpageload">
    	<xf:group class="sub_contents" id="" meta_componentContainer="true" meta_snippetCategory="00_화면시작" meta_snippetKeyComponent="true"
    		meta_snippetName="0_01 페이지시작" style="">
    		<w2:textbox tagname="h1" style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 10px;" tabIndex="h1" id="textbox1" label="Example" escape="false"></w2:textbox>
    		<w2:textbox tagname="h2" style="height: 23px;margin-bottom: 10px;color: blue;" id="textbox2" label="How to Use"></w2:textbox>
    		<w2:textbox style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 10px;" id="textbox3"
    			label='1. After selecting Title, Department, or Year, click the Search button at the bottom to confirm the search results are displayed.&lt;br/&gt;2. Click the Initialize button to confirm the search is canceled.&lt;br/&gt;3. (Select rows using the checkboxes) Click the Add button at the bottom to confirm the rows are added. &lt;br/&gt;4. Select rows using the checkboxes and click the Delete button to confirm the corresponding rows are deleted. (Rows are not actually removed but changed to a “deleted” status.)&lt;br/&gt;5. When you select a row using the checkbox and click the Remove button, verify that the row is removed.&lt;br/&gt;6. When you click the Excel button at the bottom, verify that the data displayed on the current screen is downloaded as an Excel file.&lt;br/&gt;7. When you select any row in the GridView, verify that the data for that row is displayed in the Details box below.&lt;br/&gt;(See the Script tab for detailed scripts.)'
    			escape="false">
    		</w2:textbox>
    		<xf:trigger type="button" id="trigger1"
    			style="height:42px;line-height:32px;padding:5px;background-color:blue;font-size:15px;weight: bolder;font-weight:bolder;text-align: left;margin-bottom: 30px;color: white;" ev:onclick="scwin.trigger1_onclick">
    			<xf:label><![CDATA[Download Example]]></xf:label>
    		</xf:trigger>
    		<xf:trigger type="button" id="trigger2" style="height:42px;line-height:32px;padding:5px;background-color:blue;font-size:15px;weight: bolder;font-weight:bolder;text-align: left;margin-bottom: 30px;color: white;margin-left: 30px;" ev:onclick="scwin.trigger2_onclick">
    			<xf:label><![CDATA[Download Data]]></xf:label>
    		</xf:trigger>
